    <string name="share_app_message">Smart Cleaner analyzes storage safely on your device: %1$s</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Smart Cleaner analyzes accessible files on your device. Media contents and fingerprints used for cleaning are not uploaded by the cleaning engine. Access to a WhatsApp Media folder is granted by you through Android’s system picker and remains limited to that selected folder.\n\nGoogle Mobile Ads and the consent platform may process advertising identifiers, diagnostics, and consent choices under Google’s policies. Smart Cleaner does not sell your personal files. You can change advertising privacy choices from Settings when the option is available.\n\nDeleting files is performed only after your selection and confirmation. Other apps’ private caches are protected by Android and are never presented as if Smart Cleaner silently deleted them.</string>
    <string name="terms_of_service_body">Smart Cleaner provides on-device storage analysis and deletion tools. Scan results are suggestions, not backups. Review selected files before confirming deletion because deleted documents and WhatsApp media may not be recoverable.\n\nThe app does not promise to delete private data belonging to other apps, force-stop protected processes, cool the CPU, or create storage that Android does not actually release. Availability can vary by Android version, device maker, file provider, and permissions granted by you.\n\nBy using the deletion tools, you confirm that you are authorized to manage the selected files.</string>
    <string name="about_app_body">Smart Cleaner %1$s\n\nA privacy-conscious Android cleaner focused on real storage measurements, exact duplicate detection, large-file review, WhatsApp Media management, safe cache cleanup for this app, and transparent device information.\n\nPackage identity: com.mrzekai.depoakilli</string>
